translatedData.subTitle:
Wealth doesn’t belong to those who work the hardest; it belongs to those who understand the times.
Can you believe it? Donald Trump, Elon Musk, and Justin Sun are all alumni associated with the University of Pennsylvania’s Wharton School.
They weren’t classmates, but they happen to represent three very different eras of wealth creation.
🏙️Donald Trump, Wharton graduate in 1968. Path: real estate → capital → politics;
🚀Elon Musk, dual degrees from Penn: physics + Wharton business. Path: internet → tech → AI and space;
₿Justin Sun, Penn alumnus. Path: internet → blockchain → digital assets.
